# The behaviour #5253 replaces: the decoding read throws and the scan fails with no report.
MODULE: FailsOnlyWhenLostUndecodableFaults
TARGET: FailsOnlyWhenLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an undecodable stored value faults the whole scan (#5253)
PERTURBS: Step

--- FIND
       IN /\ cursor' = k
          /\ IF v = "Absent"

--- REPLACE
       IN /\ cursor' = k
          /\ phase' = IF v = "Undec" THEN "Failed" ELSE phase
          /\ IF v = "Absent" \/ v = "Undec"

--- END

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, scanPolicy, lost>>

\* The pass ends
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<scanPolicy, lost>>

\* The pass ends
--- END
